 {c:'cap sth off with',pos:'verb phrase',ru:'завершить что-либо чем-то',m:'finish an event or period with one final thing',n:'Name the event, then keep off with before the final detail.',col:'cap off the evening with dessert'},
 {c:'pull sb through',pos:'verb phrase',ru:'помочь кому-либо выдержать трудности',m:'help someone survive or recover from a difficult experience',n:'The person usually comes between pull and through.',col:'pull a family through a crisis'},
 {c:'take its natural course',pos:'verb phrase',ru:'идти своим чередом',m:'develop without interference until reaching its own conclusion',n:'Its becomes their with a plural subject.',col:'let events take their natural course'},
 {c:'the germ of sth',pos:'noun phrase',ru:'зачаток чего-либо',m:'the earliest small beginning from which something larger develops',n:'Common partners include idea, plan, tradition, and festival.',col:'the germ of an idea'},
 {c:'blossom into',pos:'verb phrase',ru:'превратиться, расцвести во что-либо',m:'develop successfully or fully into something larger or more serious',n:'Into introduces the result. Blossom can also stand alone.',col:'blossom into a tradition'},
 {c:'throwaway gesture',pos:'noun phrase',ru:'небрежный, необдуманный жест или замечание',m:'a casual action or remark made without much thought',n:'Throwaway stays before the noun. Remark and comment are also common.',col:'make a throwaway gesture'},
 {c:'fret over',pos:'verb phrase',ru:'беспокоиться, терзаться из-за чего-либо',m:'worry repeatedly about something, often too much',n:'Over introduces the object of worry. Fret about is also possible.',col:'fret over the details'},
 {c:'be blessed with',pos:'verb phrase',ru:'быть счастливым обладателем чего-либо',m:'be fortunate enough to possess a useful quality or advantage',n:'Change be to fit the subject and time: is, was, were.',col:'be blessed with patience'},
 {c:'align neatly with',pos:'verb phrase',ru:'точно соответствовать чему-либо',m:'match something closely, conveniently, or convincingly',n:'With introduces the thing matched. Neatly comes before with.',col:'align neatly with a tradition'},
 {c:'divert attention from',pos:'verb phrase',ru:'отвлечь внимание от чего-либо',m:'make people stop focusing on something',n:'From introduces what receives less attention.',col:'divert attention from a problem'},
 {c:'downplay',pos:'verb',ru:'преуменьшать значение чего-либо',m:'make something seem less serious or important than it is',n:'Transitive: name what is being downplayed.',col:'downplay the risks'},
 {c:'avert one’s eyes from',pos:'verb phrase',ru:'отвести взгляд от чего-либо',m:'look away from something, literally or by refusing to face it',n:'The possessive changes: my, your, their. Keep from.',col:'avert your eyes from the scene'},
 {c:'send sb packing',pos:'verb phrase',ru:'выпроводить кого-либо',m:'force or tell someone to leave abruptly',n:'The person comes between send and packing. Use packing, not packed.',col:'send the critics packing'},
 {c:'contend with',pos:'verb phrase',ru:'справляться, бороться с чем-либо',m:'deal with a difficulty, opponent, or competing demand',n:'With introduces the difficulty or opponent.',col:'contend with setbacks'},
 {c:'fight it out',pos:'verb phrase',ru:'выяснить отношения, бороться до результата',m:'argue or compete until one side wins or the dispute settles',n:'It is fixed. Use over to name the subject of the dispute.',col:'fight it out over the details'},
 {c:'divide and conquer',pos:'fixed expression',ru:'разделяй и властвуй',m:'weaken a group by turning its members against one another',n:'Keep the order. As a modifier, divide-and-conquer is hyphenated.',col:'a divide-and-conquer strategy'},
 {c:'gain some breathing space',pos:'verb phrase',ru:'получить передышку',m:'get a temporary pause or extra room to think, recover, or act',n:'Space is uncountable here. Some can change to a little.',col:'gain some breathing space'},
 {c:'be at the forefront of',pos:'adjective phrase',ru:'быть в авангарде чего-либо',m:'have a leading or highly visible position in an activity or development',n:'Keep at the and of. Change be to fit the sentence.',col:'be at the forefront of change'}
],
notice:{